BSP-Yocto-phyCONTROL-Nova-i.MX8MP-v0.1    2026-01-12
====================================================

- Linux NXP Vendor Kernel v6.6.52-2.2.0-phy24 (based on NXP tag lf-6.6.52-2.2.0)
- U-boot v2024.04-2.2.0-phy23 (based on NXP tag lf-6.6.52-2.2.0)
- Yocto 5.0.4 (Scarthgap)
- OP-TEE 4.1
- RAUC 1.14

Tested Yocto Images:
--------------------
- phycontrol-image:
  * phycontrol-nova-imx8mp-1
- phycontrol-bundle:
  * phycontrol-nova-imx8mp-1

Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 22.04 64-bit

Features:
---------
- Node-RED with support for GPIO, RS232/RS485 and CAN nodes
- Cockpit interface
  - User management
  - Network configuration
  - Containers (podman)
- Package management
  - DNF package manager
  - RPM packages
- ThingsBoard gateway
- Fully redundant update system A/B with RAUC

Known Issues/Limitations:
-------------------------
- This is a pre-release. Expect bugs and incomplete configuration.
- No Secure Boot support. This is planned for a future release.
- Package management requires a package feed server to be configured manually.
- Node-RED and required nodes for the IO connector must be installed on the
  target via NPM.
